{
  "slug": "codealive-context-engine",
  "name": "Codealive Context Engine",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "CodeAlive context engine for semantic code search and AI-powered codebase Q&A. Enables AI coding agents to understand entire codebases beyond just open files — search across all indexed repositories, trace cross-service dependencies, discover usage patterns, and get synthesized answers to architectural questions. Includes a lightweight code exploration subagent, authentication hooks, and multiple search modes (fast lexical, semantic, and deep cross-cutting).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `codealive-context-engine` (Semantic search, grep, and Q&A across codebases and documentation indexed in CodeAlive)\n- **Agents** (1): `codealive-context-explorer` (Iterative code exploration across indexed repositories using CodeAlive semantic search, grep, artifact fetch, and relationship inspection)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codealive-context-engine@claude-community` from `CodeAlive-AI/codealive-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
